Package: snapi
Title: Query dbSNP dataset using the Clinical Table Search Service
Version: 0.99.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Marcel", "Ramos", , "marcel.ramos@sph.cuny.edu",
    c("aut", "cre"), c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3242-0582"))
Description: Obtain data from the dbSNP dataset as part of the Clinical
    Table Search Service. The index behind this API is built from the
    newly released JSON data. Data for both GRCh37 and GRCh38 have been
    indexed.
License: Artistic-2.0
